From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ahtsiu <ahtsiu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Nov 2026 03:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] clk: sunxi-ng: h616: disable CPU PLL notifier (workaround)

On this H618 board, enabling the CPU PLL notifier makes any CPU
frequency change able to wedge the system: the notifier reparents the
CPU clock to PLL_PERI0, reprograms PLL_CPUX and then waits for the PLL
lock bit while holding clk_prepare_lock. If the lock does not assert,
the wait never completes and every path needing clk_prepare() blocks,
including the mv64xxx I2C driver servicing the AXP313A PMIC, which is
what the CPU regulator needs.

Symptoms: partial CPU stall (tick stops, NMI not answered), followed by
"i2c i2c-1: mv64xxx: I2C bus locked" and "_set_opp_voltage: failed
... -110". Fixed-frequency operation is unaffected.

Kernel v6.12 has no such notifier and does not hang.

Keep the GPU notifiers; only the CPU side is disabled here.

Signed-off-by: ahtsiu <ahtsiu@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun50i-h616.c | 18 ------------------
 1 file changed, 0 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)
--- a/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun50i-h616.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/sunxi-ng/ccu-sun50i-h616.c
@@ -1138,19 +1138,6 @@
 	SUN50I_H616_USB3_CLK_REG,
 };
 
-static struct ccu_mux_nb sun50i_h616_cpu_nb = {
-	.common		= &cpux_clk.common,
-	.cm		= &cpux_clk.mux,
-	.delay_us	= 1, /* manual doesn't really say */
-	.bypass_index	= 4, /* PLL_PERI0@600MHz, as recommended by manual */
-};
-
-static struct ccu_pll_nb sun50i_h616_pll_cpu_nb = {
-	.common		= &pll_cpux_clk.common,
-	.enable		= BIT(29),	/* LOCK_ENABLE */
-	.lock		= BIT(28),
-};
-
 static struct ccu_mux_nb sun50i_h616_gpu_nb = {
 	.common		= &gpu0_clk.common,
 	.cm		= &gpu0_clk.mux,
@@ -1235,13 +1222,6 @@
 	if (ret)
 		return ret;
 
-	/* Reparent CPU during CPU PLL rate changes */
-	ccu_mux_notifier_register(pll_cpux_clk.common.hw.clk,
-				  &sun50i_h616_cpu_nb);
-
-	/* Re-lock the CPU PLL after any rate changes */
-	ccu_pll_notifier_register(&sun50i_h616_pll_cpu_nb);
-
 	/* Reparent GPU during GPU PLL rate changes */
 	ccu_mux_notifier_register(pll_gpu_clk.common.hw.clk,
 				  &sun50i_h616_gpu_nb);
